<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps may upgrade TransTexas Gas.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps may upgrade TransTexas Gas.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Friday it placed the rating of TransTexas Gas Corp's senior secured notes on rating watch for a possible upgrade.</p>
<p>The action follows the company's announcement it is contemplating the sale of its Lobo Trend field and certain other assets.</p>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps' rating on TransTexas Gas' $800 million in senior secured notes is Single B Plus.</p>
<p>The proposed sale of assets would reduce TransTexas Gas' leverage and allow it to more aggressively pursue development of its productive Bob West North field, Duff &amp; Phelps said.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
